# halpradio — Activity Modes with the "Programming" work mode selected
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1050
Set Height 620

Type "./halpradio -backend native -discord=false -notifications=false -mpris=false -ipc=false"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Screenshot docs/images/workmodes.png
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
